",null,-0.35,1.5,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_135","By the way, aren't you curious why I pretended not to know you? Or how I became a \"transfer from the Flavio branch\"?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"x","014",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Nope. Because I know you're dying to tell me anyway. Like right now.",1,""],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_112"],["ctl","avg1_135","b","013",null,null,0.0,1.0,null,"chijing","Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_135","Ugh... Nothing gets past you, does it, Boss?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","b","011","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.5],["say","avg1_135","I'm here undercover. United Harvest is famous for breeding and bio-research...",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","story_main_05_002",0,0.0],["cbg",0,null,-80.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["film",0],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["cbg",0,null,null,1.05,"OutSine",10.0,null,null,null],["say","avg1_135","Thanks to an exclusive franchise from the Seal of Grace, they hold a monopoly on Nova's food supply.",3,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Years ago, the founder, Samuel, had a goal: to provide people with \"cheaper and tastier food.\"",3,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_135","But now? Instead of that philosophy, everyone's just obsessed with petty factional infighting.",3,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","uniseed_warehouse_daylight",0,0.0],["film",1],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg1_135","b","021",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_135","b",null,"attention",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Let's get real for a second. United Harvest holds seventy percent of the entire continent's food supply. If a giant like that collapses from internal strife... What do you think happens to the little guy?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"x","009",null,null],["say","avg3_100","People would starve. The whole social order would fall apart.",1,""],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","b","017","exclamation",null,-0.35,1.5,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_135","Exactly! That's why I'm here chasing the big scoop. It's not just about grabbing headlines—I need to expose the real danger of letting one company hold a monopoly on our food supply.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"x","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","So you forged an ID and slipped into Mina's team right when she was short-staffed.",1,""],["mrt",0,"x","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","And now you're using the cover of an \"internal investigation\" to gather your own material.",1,""],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","b","007","music",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Heh. Great minds think alike, Boss.",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_074"],["ctl","avg1_135","b","011",null,null,0.0,1.0,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["say","avg1_135","Don't get me wrong, though. I intend to do a proper job for Mina. I'm just ... multitasking on the side.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","mood_1",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","b","007","flower",null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_135","Besides, getting Flavio's ace witch for pennies on the dollar? I'd call that a win-win★",0,""],["w",0.5],["bg","uniseed_warehouse_daylight",0,0.5],["mrt",1,"w","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Between finding Lady Gray and handling Mina's commission, Mistique's skills are too valuable to ignore. Partnering up is the logical move.",2,""],["mrt",0,"x","002","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Fair enough. Since our goals align—for the moment, anyway—why don't we pool our resources?",1,""],["mrt",3,"x",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","b","003","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_135","I'm in. And just so you know, I haven't been sitting around this past week. I've already cased the joint. I know these departments inside out★",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_135","b","005